WEBVTT

00:01.190 --> 00:02.410
I...

00:08.760 --> 00:12.310
Like you, Akihime.

00:33.660 --> 00:35.820
Akihime?

00:36.970 --> 00:38.180
A-Akihime!

00:44.040 --> 00:45.200
Akihime!

01:16.180 --> 01:22.890
Shining stars away bless

01:16.720 --> 01:22.890
Shining stars away bless

01:23.220 --> 01:28.100
chiisakutonaeru mahou no kotobawa

01:23.220 --> 01:28.100
Silently chanting the magical words

01:28.980 --> 01:30.730
『onegai。。。』

01:28.980 --> 01:30.730
"please"

01:31.020 --> 01:36.360
hoshizora samayou kaze ni notta maigo notsubu

01:31.020 --> 01:36.360
The lost grain riding the wind on the sky

01:36.360 --> 01:37.410
『kizuite。。。』

01:36.360 --> 01:37.410
Please notice

01:37.410 --> 01:45.290
tsutawara nakute porori ochita kono omoi

01:37.410 --> 01:45.290
Untold words, teardrops of feelings that fell down

01:45.790 --> 01:52.380
kagayaki dasuyo GARASU bin nonaka

01:45.790 --> 01:52.380
Show your shine inside the glass bottle

01:52.750 --> 01:59.760
manten no hoshi deatta KISEKI kimi ga soba ni itekureru nara

01:52.750 --> 01:59.760
If you will stay beside me perfect star of encountered miracles...

01:59.930 --> 02:07.140
Whatever the mystery, I will be able to gather my courage.

02:00.340 --> 02:07.140
donna fushigi mouke tomeru yuuki umare te yuku yo

02:07.480 --> 02:14.730
nanatsuiro ni hikaru houseki sora kara mai oriru

02:07.480 --> 02:14.730
Seven colored glittering gems flying down from the sky

02:14.730 --> 02:18.450
Scoop up the important fragments

02:15.150 --> 02:18.450
daijina KAKERA sukui agerune

02:18.450 --> 02:23.950
kowasa nuyou sotto。。。

02:18.450 --> 02:23.950
And secretly hold onto them tight

02:52.940 --> 02:56.900
Honey Colored Hesitation

03:07.680 --> 03:13.840
<i> I may have done something irreversible.</i>

03:15.480 --> 03:23.500
Hey, hey Yayoi-san! It's been on my mind since summer camp, but...

03:23.500 --> 03:24.420
What is it, what?

03:24.420 --> 03:26.620
The person Sumomo-chan likes...

03:26.620 --> 03:28.390
Sumomo-chan?

03:28.390 --> 03:31.520
It might be Kisaragi-sensei.

03:32.010 --> 03:38.410
Usually, Sumomo-chan is shy.

03:38.410 --> 03:43.980
But if you look, in front of Sensei she is smiling brightly.

03:43.980 --> 03:47.540
<i>I was just thinking the same thing.   </i>

03:47.540 --> 03:50.220
I see, so she's in love.

03:50.220 --> 03:53.000
Kisaragi-sensei is fun to talk to.

03:53.000 --> 03:55.080
And he has that manly characteristic about him.

03:55.080 --> 03:57.180
His legs are long too.

03:57.180 --> 03:59.380
Yep, about three times longer than Tsuwabuki's.

03:59.380 --> 04:00.320
Hey! You guys!

04:00.670 --> 04:01.830
Really?

04:01.830 --> 04:09.140
I think the best match for Sumomo-chan is someone who has been with us for a while.

04:09.140 --> 04:10.220
Right?

04:18.100 --> 04:19.040
Haru!

04:20.250 --> 04:24.110
And for that reason, today we're going to have a meeting to talk about it.

04:24.110 --> 04:25.580
Agreed!

04:25.580 --> 04:26.660
What are you talking about?!

04:27.230 --> 04:27.890
Eh?

04:27.890 --> 04:28.220
What is it?

04:29.870 --> 04:30.930
The meeting.

04:34.120 --> 04:38.830
Alright! Two bowls of seconds of Mitsumame. Here you go!

04:39.090 --> 04:40.410
I've been waiting for this!

04:40.410 --> 04:41.420
This, this!

04:41.570 --> 04:46.520
Hey hey hey, so what's this meeting about?

04:46.520 --> 04:50.320
Ahem... the best match for Akihime-san.

04:50.760 --> 04:53.640
The best match for Sumomo?

04:53.640 --> 04:55.790
So you're saying that it's not Kisaragi-sensei?

04:55.790 --> 04:56.940
Who is it?

05:03.400 --> 05:07.740
Huh? Your face is red, Tsuwabuki-kun.

05:07.740 --> 05:09.980
Why did Tsuwabuki's face turn red?

05:09.980 --> 05:11.890
Hmm, now why is that I wonder?

05:13.310 --> 05:18.240
Is it possible?! Could it be?! You like Sumomo-chan!

05:19.870 --> 05:21.800
Then does that mean you've already confessed?

05:21.800 --> 05:23.610
Did you kiss?

05:23.610 --> 05:24.770
Kiss?!

05:26.070 --> 05:28.120
Where? I wonder how many times.

05:28.840 --> 05:29.610
Guys...

05:29.610 --> 05:31.470
Alright! For now, let's all just...

05:31.470 --> 05:32.930
Now now, please calm down.

05:32.930 --> 05:35.050
How can I possibly be calm right now?

05:35.050 --> 05:37.100
Our Tsuwabuki and Sumomo-chan are going to be...

05:37.100 --> 05:39.060
Lovey lovey.

05:39.060 --> 05:41.350
Th-That's why I said it's not like that!

05:41.350 --> 05:46.250
I think that Akihime only thinks of me as a friend.

05:46.250 --> 05:48.090
What do you mean saying weak things like that?!

05:48.090 --> 05:49.700
It's all about guts, guts!

05:49.700 --> 05:52.790
That's right, there is a very good chance, even for Haru.

05:52.790 --> 05:57.130
That's right, everyone let's cheer for Tsuwabuki-kun and Sumomo-chan.

05:57.440 --> 05:59.920
Agreed!

05:59.920 --> 06:00.960
Here.

06:01.420 --> 06:04.650
As our store's special guest I'll give this to you as a present.

06:08.580 --> 06:10.190
Haru isn't very good at talking, so...

06:10.190 --> 06:11.620
"I like you," or...

06:11.620 --> 06:13.590
"Please marry me,"

06:13.590 --> 06:14.670
are things he can't say.

06:14.670 --> 06:15.710
Ma-?!

06:15.710 --> 06:18.400
In those situations, just use a cell phone.

06:18.400 --> 06:20.760
Text messaging is a good idea.

06:20.760 --> 06:23.330
Use emoticons, as they're also convenient.

06:26.440 --> 06:28.420
Stop stalling and do it already!

06:28.420 --> 06:29.930
Do your best, Tsuwabuki-kun.

06:29.930 --> 06:31.180
We're with you on this.

06:31.180 --> 06:33.070
Don't lose to Kisaragi-sensei.

06:39.880 --> 06:41.230
Guys, you know...

06:42.780 --> 06:46.200
If you keep waiting, someone will take her away from you.

06:57.290 --> 06:59.250
If you're looking for Tsuwabuki, he went home already.

07:00.530 --> 07:03.610
It looks like he went to Limelight with everyone.

07:04.280 --> 07:09.110
Limelight is Flora-chan's store, right?

07:13.880 --> 07:18.650
Sumomo, looks like something good happened between you and Tsuwabuki-kun.

07:20.910 --> 07:25.120
Today, Sumomo looks different than usual.

07:25.460 --> 07:30.060
I've watched Sumomo since I was little.

07:30.060 --> 07:34.770
During our elementary school years, when you could finally swing on the bar...

07:34.770 --> 07:38.960
It made me happy to see Sumomo so full of joy.

07:40.910 --> 07:42.890
It's calming.

07:42.890 --> 07:47.050
Today, I'm very happy like I was back then.

07:47.570 --> 07:49.090
Nako-chan.

07:58.170 --> 07:59.290
That was...

08:06.170 --> 08:11.650
A technique that I, the best in Saint Aspalas, have never seen before.

08:13.470 --> 08:14.920
Matsuda.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.680
Yes, Miss!

08:16.680 --> 08:18.460
What do you think?

08:18.460 --> 08:23.890
Yes, my breath was taken away just like you, Miss.

08:23.890 --> 08:28.650
It was more wonderful than anything I've ever dreamed of.

08:28.650 --> 08:30.390
Right, Miss?

08:35.540 --> 08:39.460
Please gather 1000 years worth of Figurare's data right now.

08:42.010 --> 08:45.570
The lake froze in an instant.

08:45.570 --> 08:47.660
With a technique as strong as that...

08:47.850 --> 08:50.710
There should be a clue somewhere.

08:53.980 --> 08:56.630
Nothing, even here.

08:57.370 --> 08:58.580
Wrong, next!

08:59.500 --> 09:02.020
Next! Next! Next! Next!

09:04.170 --> 09:05.370
Next!

09:14.350 --> 09:15.650
That's it!

09:19.240 --> 09:22.490
Moterios Oludin Radium.

09:22.730 --> 09:26.830
A powerful technique that decreases the temperature in the surroundings instantly.

09:26.830 --> 09:29.000
There is no mistake, this is it.

09:29.990 --> 09:32.490
In the long history of Figurare,

09:32.490 --> 09:37.000
only a few prodigies were able to use this technique.

09:37.590 --> 09:43.570
At least for the past hundred years, only one has used this technique.

09:43.570 --> 09:45.010
And that person is...

09:51.550 --> 09:53.010
Karin-sama?

09:55.270 --> 09:59.030
The one who Miss has admired since her childhood?

09:59.700 --> 10:05.220
The legendary Stellar Spinear, the girl genius who broke all the records of Figurare.

10:06.760 --> 10:10.510
Eighteen years ago, Karin-sama went to Retroscena.

10:10.510 --> 10:15.060
No one doubted that she would win the race of collecting the star drops.

10:15.060 --> 10:18.980
But Karin-sama never returned to Figurare.

10:19.690 --> 10:20.890
Never again.

10:24.340 --> 10:26.380
<i>I ended up agreeing to this. </i>

10:30.630 --> 10:33.610
I'll tell you Sumomo-chan's phone number.

10:33.970 --> 10:37.860
I'll give Sumomo-chan Tsuwabuki's number too.

10:38.190 --> 10:40.860
How about you send her a greeting text message first?

10:40.860 --> 10:42.320
Don't worry.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.490
Guts!

10:46.420 --> 10:48.620
<i>I've never thought about messaging... </i>

10:49.300 --> 10:51.450
<i>But still, I want to talk face to face.</i>

10:53.230 --> 10:54.870
<i>My honest feelings.</i>

11:13.750 --> 11:15.790
<i>There's no way that she'd still be here.</i>

11:16.700 --> 11:19.300
<i>What am I expecting?</i>

11:48.810 --> 11:50.180
Sensei...

11:50.490 --> 11:52.700
You know, Sumomo-chan...

11:52.700 --> 11:56.350
We're the only ones here, and there's no one else around.

11:56.350 --> 11:58.640
So you don't need to call me Sensei.

12:03.230 --> 12:05.730
Wow, a picture of them together.

12:05.730 --> 12:09.750
Sensei, did you print two of them on purpose?

12:09.750 --> 12:12.360
I told you, it's not Sensei.

12:12.360 --> 12:17.200
It was embarrassing in front of everyone, so calling you Sensei became a habit.

12:18.980 --> 12:22.970
It's about time we told them about us.

12:35.830 --> 12:39.030
Hmm? It felt like there was someone here...

12:40.200 --> 12:41.270
Dad!

12:42.190 --> 12:46.090
I heard you found something important so I came to see.

12:46.090 --> 12:47.410
Welcome, Nii-san.

12:48.420 --> 12:50.690
Here it is, Dad.

12:50.700 --> 12:54.290
Well, this is nostalgic.

12:54.600 --> 12:58.210
Our wedding photo.

12:58.210 --> 13:01.440
Dad and Mom look wonderful.

13:05.040 --> 13:10.550
<i>As I thought, the one who Akihime likes is Kisaragi-sensei.  </i>

13:18.240 --> 13:21.980
<i>I don't want to see anyone tonight.   </i>

13:22.570 --> 13:24.540
<i>Also, it's a new moon. </i>

13:24.540 --> 13:26.910
<i>I can remain in my human form. </i>

13:27.440 --> 13:30.000
<i>I don't need to go to Akihime. </i>

13:37.000 --> 13:42.380
Dad and Mom married out of love, right?

13:43.020 --> 13:47.000
Karin-san... your mother, you heard it from her?

13:57.530 --> 13:59.590
Once every hundred years.

13:59.590 --> 14:03.700
The technique that only Karin-sama was able to use. And on her first try.

14:03.700 --> 14:06.410
But that girl... How?

14:17.210 --> 14:20.310
Nee-san sure is pretty.

14:26.570 --> 14:27.800
Stop.

14:28.060 --> 14:31.310
Although I couldn't say it in front of Nee-san.

14:36.010 --> 14:37.640
This is...

14:38.400 --> 14:39.880
It's you.

14:42.760 --> 14:45.770
Please tell me the truth!

14:46.490 --> 14:48.860
This bride is Karin-sama...

14:48.860 --> 14:53.670
The one called the legendary Stellar Spinear, right?

14:53.670 --> 14:54.970
Correct.

14:55.620 --> 14:57.940
And this person is...

15:03.010 --> 15:06.500
I can still remember that event eighteen years ago.

15:08.120 --> 15:13.510
That was a night of miracles no one had ever seen.

15:17.110 --> 15:19.380
Puru Radi Ecresiang

15:22.560 --> 15:25.410
With one spell, Nee-san...

15:26.000 --> 15:29.260
gathered six star drops in a blink of an eye.

15:29.490 --> 15:31.290
Can you believe it?

15:33.830 --> 15:37.700
And then, it was when she was about to gather the seventh star drop.

15:48.220 --> 15:51.260
Gaterius Oludin Radium

15:58.470 --> 16:02.370
Both of them fell in love at first sight.

16:03.560 --> 16:10.570
Back then humans from Retroscena and humans from Figurare were forbidden to marry each other.

16:14.820 --> 16:19.070
Onee-sama threw away her title of genius Stellar Spinear.

16:19.350 --> 16:22.750
To be in the arms of just one person.

16:30.400 --> 16:32.980
<i>That is Akihime Seishiro.</i>

16:32.980 --> 16:36.070
<i>Sumomo-chan is the daughter of those two.</i>

16:37.360 --> 16:40.830
<i>But by regulations, the whole issue was kept a secret.</i>

16:40.830 --> 16:46.030
<i>Sumomo-chan still doesn't know that her mother was a person from Figurare.</i>

16:51.480 --> 16:55.700
Sumomo-chan, I wonder if I ever told you this...

16:56.840 --> 17:02.040
The first time when I told Karin-san my feelings.

17:03.230 --> 17:04.690
Your feelings?

17:10.630 --> 17:14.520
My heart was beating so fast, that it felt like it was going to stop.

17:16.010 --> 17:20.560
"Am I really the right person for Karin-san?"

17:20.560 --> 17:24.440
"Am I causing trouble for Karin-san?"

17:24.440 --> 17:26.540
That's not true!

17:26.540 --> 17:32.100
Mom was not troubled, because to Mom, Dad was...

17:34.030 --> 17:36.460
When you get to really like someone...

17:36.460 --> 17:39.070
you get so nervous you can't endure it.

17:39.430 --> 17:43.750
Waiting for Karin-san's answer felt so long.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.690
It felt like a million years.

17:47.450 --> 17:50.730
But in truth it was only ten seconds.

17:52.780 --> 17:56.070
Karin-san answered me right away.

17:58.770 --> 18:02.370
I love you too.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.770
Sumomo-chan?

18:16.110 --> 18:19.740
I'm sorry, I have to go back to school!

18:19.740 --> 18:21.280
There is something important I have to do!

18:28.560 --> 18:34.730
<i>Come to think of it, it's been a while since I looked at the night sky alone. </i>

18:41.010 --> 18:42.380
Akihime...

18:43.670 --> 18:45.340
<i>I've finally realized...</i>

18:46.360 --> 18:52.480
<i>No matter who Akihime likes, I like Akihime.</i>

18:56.170 --> 18:59.390
<i>Since when did I, about Akihime...</i>

19:00.770 --> 19:05.130
<i>After becoming Yuki-chan it seemed as though I knew a lot about Akihime. </i>

19:05.130 --> 19:07.570
<i>But it may be that I still don't know anything. </i>

19:10.600 --> 19:12.090
<i>Akihime...</i>

19:18.970 --> 19:22.870
I have something important I want to tell you.

19:22.870 --> 19:25.470
I'll wait at the secret place...

19:28.880 --> 19:30.900
<i>This was two hours ago.</i>

19:53.560 --> 19:58.870
I'll pretend Yuki-chan is here right now.

20:00.130 --> 20:03.110
Then I can have more courage.

20:03.110 --> 20:09.960
I'll get it across, just like Mom. My true feelings, surely...

20:20.010 --> 20:23.720
Tsuwabuki-kun, I'm sorry about yesterday.

20:24.300 --> 20:28.960
It was too nerve-racking. It felt like a dream.

20:28.960 --> 20:32.160
I ran away because I was scared.

20:33.380 --> 20:36.410
I thought I would wake up from the dream.

20:37.530 --> 20:43.090
It was as if I wasn't the girl that Tsuwabuki-kun was thinking of.

20:43.090 --> 20:48.670
I'm not good at talking and I'm uninteresting, so I might disappoint you.

20:50.030 --> 20:52.100
To think like that caused me a lot of pain.

20:52.980 --> 20:56.830
This choked up feeling in my chest was painful.

20:56.830 --> 20:58.130
So...

20:59.630 --> 21:00.840
I feel the same way.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.580
I...

21:13.210 --> 21:19.450
never knew that liking someone would be this painful.

21:29.080 --> 21:30.430
I like you.

21:32.620 --> 21:34.430
<i>There's nothing else I can say.</i>

21:35.400 --> 21:39.640
<i>I can feel that Akihime is here, but the words won't come out.  </i>

21:40.190 --> 21:42.470
<i>If I stand in front of Akihime. </i>

21:52.480 --> 21:54.280
Me too.

21:55.870 --> 21:59.440
Tsuwabuki-kun... I like you.

22:13.630 --> 22:14.880
This is...

22:15.560 --> 22:17.940
It's the stray acorn.

22:17.940 --> 22:19.290
Stray?

22:22.810 --> 22:26.440
Let's plant this together.

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
kira kira no hoshikuzu ha maru de

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
Fragments of glittering stars

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
koi suru otome no kiseki

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
are just like the miracles of a girl in love

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
kinou mada no watashi ha doko he

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
Where did the cleverness from yesterday go,

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
nanika chigau RABIRINSU

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
Since it's like a labyrinth now

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
dan dan wakan naku naru

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
Slowly becoming confused

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
（doushi you　doushi you）

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
What do I do? What do I do?

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
don don afurete kuru　AH　HAHAHA

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
Slowly becoming overflowed

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
yume no naka jya　nandemo ieru no ni…

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
But inside a dream, can't you say anything?

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
yuuki kudasai

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
Please give me courage

23:30.370 --> 23:32.000
mo-o！

23:30.370 --> 23:32.000
Mo-o!

23:32.170 --> 23:36.840
konna ni aitai no ni

23:32.170 --> 23:36.840
I really want to meet you

23:36.840 --> 23:39.130
kanari Bi-myo

23:36.840 --> 23:39.130
Proxy doll

23:39.300 --> 23:43.050
toki meki ga koi no saidai no teki

23:39.300 --> 23:43.050
This throbbing is love's biggest challenge

23:43.050 --> 23:44.640
jirettai no yo

23:43.050 --> 23:44.640
It's irritating

23:44.640 --> 23:45.970
ne-e

23:44.640 --> 23:45.970
Isn't it?

23:46.390 --> 23:51.100
yume kara sametara mata

23:46.390 --> 23:51.100
The reasons to wake again

23:51.100 --> 23:56.650
kobore souna kimi no egao ni

23:51.100 --> 23:56.650
Are overflowing to see your smile

23:56.650 --> 23:59.570
airu kana

23:56.650 --> 23:59.570
If we meet again

24:10.140 --> 24:11.680
Thank you for waiting!

24:10.720 --> 24:12.380
Next Episode

24:11.680 --> 24:12.100
Finally!

24:12.100 --> 24:12.710
At last!

24:12.710 --> 24:13.750
Should I summarize and tell?

24:13.750 --> 24:15.100
A couple is born!

24:16.350 --> 24:17.900
I'm jealous, it's their first date!

24:17.900 --> 24:20.100
They probably can't hear our voices.

24:20.100 --> 24:21.270
Sweet...

24:21.270 --> 24:22.520
Those two's world...

24:21.940 --> 24:24.900
Episode 8

24:21.940 --> 24:24.900
Blissful Colored Wing

24:22.520 --> 24:24.900
It might not work out that well.
